OL,3,AUS strikes Iranian launchers on Larak
OL,4,AIsland in first known attack in weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS forces have struck two Iranian
OL,7,Flaunchers on Iran's Larak island, a US
OL,8,Fofficial said, marking the first known
OL,9,FAmerican strikes on Iran since late
OL,10,FJuly.
OL,12,F"Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps
OL,13,F(IRGC) forces were observed preparing
OL,14,Fto launch rockets with sea mines into
OL,15,FStrait of Hormuz," the BBC's US partner
OL,16,FCBS News quoted US Central Command
OL,17,Fspokesman Cdr Tim Hawkins as saying.
OL,19,FThe IRGC said the attack on Sunday
OL,20,Fkilled and wounded several people, and
OL,21,Fvowed "response and punishment".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
