OL,3,AUS strikes Iranian launchers on Larak
OL,4,AIsland in first known attack in weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt marks the first known US strike in
OL,7,FIran since US President Donald Trump
OL,8,Fpaused a renewed military campaign in
OL,9,Flate July. The US said it had finished
OL,10,Fclearing all mines from the strait's
OL,11,Fmain shipping lane earlier this month.
